@page "/stammdaten"

<PageTitle>Master Data</PageTitle>

<h1>Master Data</h1>

<p class="text-muted">
    Management of the emulator's registered banks, partners (customers) and subscribers:
    create, edit, delete as well as subscriber lifecycle state and permissions.
</p>

@* Static-SSR page with interactive islands per aggregate (ADR-0009: render mode at the embedding site).
   The components write in-process through the IMasterDataManager (EBICO.Server). *@
<BankManager @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
<PartnerManager @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
<SubscriberManager @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
